1
00:00:03,109 --> 00:00:05,382
The volcano rumbles and spits lava!

2
00:00:05,432 --> 00:00:07,838
Mila steps back, Noah's eyes go wide.

3
00:00:07,888 --> 00:00:09,812
What is pushing all that out?

4
00:00:10,608 --> 00:00:12,772
Mila shakes a bottle of soda.

5
00:00:12,822 --> 00:00:13,077
Pop!

6
00:00:13,127 --> 00:00:14,680
It sprays everywhere.

7
00:00:14,730 --> 00:00:15,825
Noah is soaked…

8
00:00:15,875 --> 00:00:17,325
and he has an idea.

9
00:00:18,102 --> 00:00:19,616
Discovery mission!

10
00:00:22,132 --> 00:00:22,751
Mini mode!

11
00:00:22,801 --> 00:00:26,768
Under the volcano, the burning-hot rock melts: that's magma.

12
00:00:26,818 --> 00:00:28,910
Lighter than the rock around it,

13
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:31,169
it rises, like a bubble in syrup.

14
00:00:31,961 --> 00:00:35,044
Inside the magma, gas is squeezed by the pressure.

15
00:00:35,094 --> 00:00:38,490
As it rises, the pressure drops: the gas makes bubbles,

16
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,294
and they push the magma out!

17
00:00:41,098 --> 00:00:42,760
If the magma rises slowly,

18
00:00:42,810 --> 00:00:45,328
the gas escapes gently: the lava flows.

19
00:00:45,378 --> 00:00:48,555
If it rises fast, the gas bursts out all at once:

20
00:00:48,605 --> 00:00:50,383
boom, the volcano explodes!

21
00:00:51,162 --> 00:00:54,634
Outside, magma is called lava: red, burning hot,

22
00:00:54,684 --> 00:00:57,568
it flows and then cools into black rock.

23
00:00:57,618 --> 00:01:00,259
The volcano grows, little by little.

24
00:01:01,024 --> 00:01:03,462
That's why volcanoes erupt.

25
00:01:04,565 --> 00:01:06,674
Magma rises because it is lighter,

26
00:01:06,724 --> 00:01:08,755
and its gas bubbles push it out.

27
00:01:10,020 --> 00:01:11,471
Outside, with an adult:

28
00:01:11,521 --> 00:01:13,755
shake a bottle of soda and open it.

29
00:01:13,805 --> 00:01:15,713
The bubbles push the soda out,

30
00:01:15,763 --> 00:01:17,786
just like gas pushes the magma!

31
00:01:18,562 --> 00:01:21,078
And how does sound travel to our ears?

32
00:01:21,128 --> 00:01:22,478
The answer tomorrow.
